"warranty":null,"specifications":{"Model / SKU":"GZS24NMYES","Category":"Refrigerators","Gallery images":"14"},"rawSpecifications":"Hydration just got a serious upgrade with GE Appliances Refrigeration. Our redesigned Side-by-Sides have an extra tall, 11-inch water dispenser, so there's no more tilting and spilling just to get your favorite water bottle to fit. Additional features take organization to the next level: adjustable shelves help fit tall items wherever you need them, wide shelves accommodate half baking sheets, an in-door icemaker creates freezer shelf space, and extra-large door bins help fit everyone in the family's groceries. Extra tall 11 in. water dispenser for easy access Adjustable shelves accommodate large items Door alarm signals when a door has been accidentally opened Water filter Sold Seperately (Model # XWFE). Visit page to see subscription service options. Extra Tall Water Dispenser - Easily access filtered water and ice from an extra tall, 11 in. dispenser made to fill everyone in the family's favorite water bottle In-Door Icemaker - Located on the freezer door to create more usable shelf storage space. Dispense cubed and crushed ice through the door. Extra Large Storage Capacity - It's easy to stay organized with extra room to store large or bulk food items with 24 cubic feet of storage space. Extra Large Adjustable Door Bins - Move the clear door bins up and down to fit your storage needs - whether it's large gallons, tall bottles, or everyday essentials. Two of the fresh food bins are extra large, which means you can fit two gallons of milk plus more, all in just one bin. Adjustable Fresh Food Shelves - Store more of your favorite tall items like milk cartons and two-liters with three adjustable refrigerator shelves. Wide Fresh Food Shelves - Take advantage of wide, wall-to-wall glass shelves - perfect for storing party platters, half baking sheets, and more. Adjustable Freezer Shelves - Organize your way with three adjustable freezer shelves that allow you to store 12-inch frozen pizza boxes flat or standing. Advanced water filtration - Reduces trace pharmaceuticals from water and ice* (* Removes 98% of ibuprofen, atenolol, fluoxetine, progesterone and trimethoprim. These pharmaceuticals are not necessarily in all users' water) Freezer Storage Drawer - A dedicated freezer drawer helps store bagged frozen items, making it easier to sort, store, and find exactly what you need. Two Fresh Food Storage Drawers - Two spacious fresh-food drawers give your family plenty of room to store produce, lunch essentials, and all the little extras that keep the week moving. LED Lighting - Find exactly what you're looking for under crisp, clear, LED lighting. Click here to shop more GE refrigerators Advanced Water and Ice Filtration - The included refrigerator water filter reduces 50+ impurities including lead, chlorine, microplastics, and PFOA/PFOS; providing clean, safe drinking water and ice. Click here to shop more GE appliances Internal Temperature Controls - Moving the temperature controls to the fresh food section gives you a modern exterior. MultiVent Cooling - Multiple vents distribute air flow to help keep set temperatures consistent. Door Alarm - Protect your groceries with a door alarm that signals when a door has accidentally been left open. Click here for more information on Electronic Recycling Programs","supplierOffers":[{"supplier":"The Home Depot","supplierUrl":"","supplierSku":"1015802628","supplierPrice":2099,"availability":"UNKNOWN","lastCheckedAt":"2026-09-22"}],"sourcePrice":2099,"retailPrice":1679.2,"imageUsageApproved":true,"sourceImageUrl":"https://images.thdstatic.com/productImages/587dad7f-6514-4389-867d-be2d22635886/svn/fingerprint-resistant-slate-ge-side-by-side-refrigerators-gzs24nmyes-64_600.jpg","sourceDetailImageUrl":"https://images.thdstatic.com/productImages/587dad7f-6514-4389-867d-be2d22635886/svn/fingerprint-resistant-slate-ge-side-by-side-refrigerators-gzs24nmyes-64_600.jpg",